Modify right cluster to 2x2 grid, adjust sizes and gaps:
```
.touch { padding: 0 max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) max(14px,...); justify-content: space-between; }
.touch-cluster { gap: 10px; }
.right-cluster { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 62px); grid-auto-rows: 62px; gap: 10px; align-items:center; }
